OL,3,ASwinney insists Scotland's NHS is safe
OL,4,Adespite hospital scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first minister has insisted that
OL,7,FScotland's NHS is "fundamentally safe"
OL,8,Fdespite concerns raised about care at
OL,9,FNHS Grampian.
OL,11,FThe health board has continued to face
OL,12,Fscrutiny following the publication of a
OL,13,Fleaked report that revealed 19
OL,14,Favoidable deaths among 45 patients in
OL,15,Fliver and pancreatic surgery at
OL,16,FAberdeen Royal Infirmary (ARI).
OL,18,FLast week, the Scottish government
OL,19,Fannounced an independent review into
OL,20,Fconcerns around hepatobiliary (HPB)
OL,21,Fsurgery at the health board.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
