OL,3,ASwinney insists Scotland's NHS is safe
OL,4,Adespite hospital scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Swinney acknowledged that mistakes
OL,7,Fcan occur but insisted patients should
OL,8,Fstill attend appointments, procedures
OL,9,Fand surgeries.
